 !                                                                               
 ! Calculation of molecular oxygen using the (0,2) sector of Fock space          
 !                                                                               
 **DIRAC                                                                         
 .TITLE                                                                          
 Moelcular oxygen. Ground and excited states (X, a, b).                          
 .WAVE F                                                                         
 **HAMILTONIAN                                                                   
 .LVCORR                                                                         
 **WAVE FUNCTIONS                                                                
 .DHF                                                                            
 .RELCCSD                                                                        
 *DHFCAL                                                                         
 .CLOSED SHELL                                                                   
  6 8                                                                            
 .EVCCNV                                                                         
 1.E-10                                                                          
 *END OF                                                                         
                                                                                 
  &RELCCSD NELEC=2,2,3,3, DOFSPC=T, DOENER=F &END                                
  &CCFSPC MAXIT=100, NACTP=2,2,0,0, FSSECT=1,1,0,0,1,0, &END                     
                                                                                 


